rs in a firm using a Manual. After this experience, he further installs 50 computers in another firm without use of manual. Engineer has transferred his knowledge from ( ).\n\nOptions: \nA. Explicit to Tacit\nB. Tacit to Explicit\nC. Explicit to General\nD. General to Expertise\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{A}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 536, "output_tokens": 238, "total_tokens": 774}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "ArcMMLU_656", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Knowledge has very short life but it use make it ( ).\n\nOptions: \nA. New and Durable\nB. Useless and wastage of time\nC. Refreshing and revalidating\nD. Everlasting and Interesting\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{C}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 454, "output_tokens": 228, "total_tokens": 682}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "ArcMMLU_664", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Aquiring new ideas based on hundreds of previously stored concepts:( ).\n\nOptions: \nA. Learning by example\nB. Learning by Experience\nC. Learning by Discovery\nD. Chunking\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The correct answer is D. Chunking, as it involves combining smaller pieces of information into larger, meaningful units based on existing knowledge. Learning by example, experience, or discovery focuses more on acquiring new concepts directly rather than integrating them from a large set of stored concepts. Thus, chunking best describes acquiring new ideas from hundreds of previously stored concepts.\n\n\\boxed{D}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 518, "output_tokens": 329, "total_tokens": 847}, "model_used": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "ArcMMLU_671", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: The main focus of Knowledge management in a firm is:( ).\n\nOptions: \nA. Leverage knowledge resources to achieve business objectives\nB. Information Management\nC. Document Management\nD. Process Improvement\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{A}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 416, "output_tokens": 209, "total_tokens": 625}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "ArcMMLU_672", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: The main purpose 