\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{A}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 576, "output_tokens": 464, "total_tokens": 1040}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "ArcMMLU_29", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Provided RcvBuffer=20,LastByteRcvd=20,LastByteRead=15, then RcvWindow=( ) \n\nOptions: \nA. 14\nB. 15\nC. 16\nD. 10\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{B}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 484, "output_tokens": 301, "total_tokens": 785}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "ArcMMLU_41", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: In static congestion window, if it satisfies W*S/R > RTT + S/R, the Latency is( ) \n\nOptions: \nA. W*S/R \u2013 ( RTT+ S/R)\nB. 2RTT + O/R\nC. 2RTT + O/R + (k-1)[W* S/R- (RTT + S/R)]\nD. 2RTT + S/R\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The condition W*S/R > RTT + S/R implies the link is underutilized during the slow start or when the window is too large relative to the RTT, typically causing idle periods. The latency in such a static window model is often expressed as 2RTT + O/R plus additional waiting time when the window limits throughput.  \nThus, the correct answer is option C.\n\n\\boxed{C}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 753, "output_tokens": 553, "total_tokens": 1306}, "model_used": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "ArcMMLU_62", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Suppose the following three 8-bit bytes: 01010101, 01110000, 01001100. What\u2019s the 1s complement of the sum of these 8-bit bytes? ( )\n\nOptions: \nA. 00010001\nB. 11101101\nC. 00010010\nD. 10001000\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{B}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 688, "output_tokens": 1032, "total_tokens": 1720}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "ArcMMLU_296", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: What is the suitable reference sources to find out the list of historical monuments of Delhi? ( ) \n\nOptions: \nA. Atlas\nB. Gazetteer\nC. Guide book\nD. Globe\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\b