ck within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{A}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 532, "output_tokens": 272, "total_tokens": 804}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "ArcMMLU_502", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Which of the following statements about network economics is not true? ( )\n\nOptions: \nA. Uber is an example of a business model that is based on the principle of network economics.\nB. The law of diminishing returns does not always apply to every situation.\nC. From a network economics perspective, the value of a community of people grows as the number of participants in the community increases.\nD. In network economics, the marginal cost of adding new members to the network is higher than the marginal gain.\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{D}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 656, "output_tokens": 236, "total_tokens": 892}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "ArcMMLU_504", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Sociotechnical changes affecting a firm adopting new information systems requiring organizational change can be considered. ( )\n\nOptions: \nA. organizational adjustments.\nB. strategic transitions.\nC. systems alterations.\nD. business goa