: None\n\nQuestion: What's the maximum number of edges in a simple planar graph with 30 vertices?\n\nOptions: \nA. 150\nB. 84\nC. 75\nD. 60\nE. 120\nF. 105\nG. 100\nH. 45\nI. 90\nJ. 135\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{B}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 600, "output_tokens": 372, "total_tokens": 972}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "MMLUPro_computer science_9219", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: What is the output of the following program? PROGRAM TEST (output); VAR I, J, K, COUNT : integer; BEGIN I: = 1; J: = 2; K: = 3; count: = 1; write1n (I div J, K mod J); while count < = 3 DO BEGIN If I < J then If K > J then If (K > I) or (I = J) then write1n (I) ELSE write1n (J) ELSE write1n (K); CASE COUNT OF 1: J: = 0; 2: BEGIN K: = K - 1; J: = J + K END; 3:I: = 2 \\textasteriskcentered I; END; count : = count + 1; END {{while count........}} END.\n\nOptions: \nA. 2 2\nB. 2 3\nC. 1 0\nD. 0 2\nE. 3 2\nF. 0 1\nG. 2 1\nH. 3 0\nI. 1 1\nJ. 1 2\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{F}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 1256, "output_tokens": 620, "total_tokens": 1876}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "MMLUPro_computer science_9221", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Let x = 1. What is x << 3 in Python 3?\n\nOptions: \nA. 16\nB. 4\nC. 8\nD. 5\nE. 10\nF. 2\nG. 12\nH. 3\nI. 1\nJ. 6\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{C}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 544, "output_tokens": 314, "total_tokens": 858}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "MMLUPro_computer science_9223", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Which of the following is the hexadecimal representation of the decimal number 231_{{10}} ?\n\nOptions: \nA. 1F_{{16}}\nB. 17_{{16}}\nC. D2_{{16}}\nD. E4_{{16}}\nE. A5_{{16}}\nF. F4_{{16}}\nG. B3_{{16}}\nH. C7_{{16}}\nI. E7_{{16}}\nJ. FE_{{16}}\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{I}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 720, "output_tokens": 284, "total_tokens": 1004}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "MMLUPro_computer science_9224", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: The color of a pixel can be represented using the RGB (Red, Green, Blue) color model, which stores values