gh doesn't stop by.\nD. It's not true that Marina reads a Percy Jackson book only when Izzy plays Minecraft, but Izzy plays Minecraft only when Ashleigh stops by.\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{A}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 1056, "output_tokens": 300, "total_tokens": 1356}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "MMLU_formal_logic_82", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion:  Select the best translation into predicate logic. All birds live in some nest. (Bx: x is a bird; Nx: x is a nest; Lxy: x lives in y)\n\nOptions: \nA. (\u2200x)(\u2200y)[(Bx \u2022 Ny) \u2283 Lxy]\nB. (\u2200x)[Bx \u2283 (\u2203y)(Ny \u2022 Lxy)]\nC. (\u2200x)[(\u2203y)(Ny \u2022 Bx) \u2283 Lxy]\nD. (\u2200x)(\u2203y)[(Bx \u2022 Ny) \u2283 Lxy]\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{B}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 678, "output_tokens": 309, "total_tokens": 987}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "MMLU_formal_logic_110", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion:  Select the best translation into predicate logic: All first-year students take a swim test.\n\nOptions: 