nergy\nD. Rule of 72 is a tax code regulation for retirement accounts\nE. Rule of 72 is a mathematical principle that determines the age of the universe\nF. Rule of 72 is an economic theory that predicts market crashes\nG. Rule of 72 is a guideline for calculating the rate of inflation\nH. Rule of 72 is used to approximate the doubling time of the population, or of interest\nI. Rule of 72 is a population growth prediction model\nJ. Rule of 72 is a health guideline for daily caloric intake based on age\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{H}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 999, "output_tokens": 321, "total_tokens": 1320}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "MMLUPro_economics_5895", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: According to Say's law\n\nOptions: \nA. when price goes up supply goes up\nB. price and supply have no correlation\nC. when supply goes up, demand goes down\nD. demand creates its own supply\nE. when demand goes up, supply goes down\nF. when demand goes up, price goes down\nG. supply creates its own demand\nH. it is better to give than receive\nI. price creates its own demand\nJ. it is better to receive than give\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{G}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 672, "output_tokens": 232, "total_tokens": 904}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-250