orate level and again at the personal level when dividends are distributed to stockholders.\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{J}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 1096, "output_tokens": 268, "total_tokens": 1364}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "MMLUPro_economics_6326", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: How does freedom of choice fit in the capitalist framework?\n\nOptions: \nA. Capitalism restricts freedom of choice\nB. Freedom of choice opposes the principles of capitalism\nC. Freedom of choice is an essential feature of capitalism\nD. Freedom of choice is irrelevant in capitalism\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{C}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 480, "output_tokens": 239, "total_tokens": 719}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "MMLUPro_economics_5695", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: The Federal Reserve's most important control instrument is open-market operations. How is it that selling government bonds can reduce bank reserves?\n\nOptions: \nA. The bank will lose an equivalent amount of reserve balances with the 