ndex": "QANTA_Social Science_1220", "prompt": "Please read the following question and provide the correct answer.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: One passage of this text criticizes the communists who believe they have found the \"deliverance from our evils,\" claiming that the abolition of private property will only lead to increased \"prerogative in the  eld of sexual relationships.\n\nProvide the correct answer in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct and the most common answer to the question. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The passage is from Friedrich Engels's *The Origin of the Family, Private Property and the State*. In it, Engels critiques simplistic communist notions about abolishing private property, arguing that such change alone would not automatically liberate sexual relationships. Thus, the correct answer is Engels.\n\n\\boxed{Engels}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 536, "output_tokens": 526, "total_tokens": 1062}, "model_used": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "QANTA_Social Science_1248", "prompt": "Please read the following question and provide the correct answer.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: In a classic experiment on this process, participants were divided into two groups, which both watched a video of a job interview; one group was told the job was \"submariner,\" while the other was told it was \"astronaut.\"\n\nProvide the correct answer in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct and the most common answer to the question. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{Confirmation bias}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 532, "output_tokens": 283, "total_tokens": 815}, "model_used": "deepseek/deeps