nal answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{T\u011b\u017eko \u0159\u00edct, ale zd\u00e1 se, \u017ee tento druh konceptu by tak\u00e9 fungoval v\u00fdhradn\u011b pro mu\u017ee.}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 252, "output_tokens": 774, "total_tokens": 1026}, "model_used": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_379", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nBy algorithmically analyzing DNA extracted from Manning and using it to create 30 portraits of what someone with that genomic data might look like, Dewey-Hagborg has created a trenchant, if somewhat cerebral, commentary on not only the malleability of DNA data - the many ways it can be interpreted, and the inherent determinism of those interpretations - but also identity.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{Indem Dewey-Hagborg DNA, die Manning entnommen wurde, algorithmisch analysierte und daraus 30 Portr\u00e4ts erstellte, wie jemand mit diesen genetischen Daten aussehen k\u00f6nnte, schuf sie einen scharfsinnigen, wenn auch etwas intellektuellen Kommentar nicht nur zur Ver\u00e4nderlichkeit von DNA-Daten \u2013 den vielen Arten, wie sie interpretiert werden k\u00f6nnen, und dem inh\u00e4renten Determinismus dieser Interpretationen \u2013 sondern auch zur Identit\u00e4t.}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 568, "output_tokens": 834, "total_tokens": 1402}, "model_used": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "WMT19-lt-en_135", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to Lithuanian.\n\nHow does a dog determine the direction of human tracks?\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{Kaip \u0161uo nustato \u017emogaus p\u0117dsak\u0173 krypt\u012f?}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 200, "output_tokens": 189, "total_tokens": 389}, "model_used": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_715", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nThe start-ups that will help your company avoid becoming the next Uber\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{Die Start-ups, die Ihrem Unternehmen helfen werden, zu vermeiden, das n\u00e4chste Uber zu werden}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 168, "output_tokens": 99, "total_tokens": 267}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "WMT19-gu-en_542", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nNow let's see what the difference is between the Reliance Jio old phone and the new Jio 2.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\u0ab9\u0ab5\u0ac7 \u0a9a\u0abe\u0ab2\u0acb \u0a9c\u0acb\u0a88\u0a8f \u0ab0\u0abf\u0ab2\u0abe\u0aaf\u0aa8\u0acd\u0ab8 \u0a9c\u0abf\u0aaf\u0acb\u0aa8\u0abe \u0a9c\u0ac2\u0aa8\u0abe \u0aab\u0acb\u0aa8 \u0a85\u0aa8\u0ac7 \u0aa8\u0ab5\u0abe \u0a9c\u0abf\u0aaf\u0acb 2 \u0ab5\u0a9a\u0acd\u0a9a\u0ac7 \u0ab6\u0ac1\u0a82 \u0aa4\u0aab\u0abe\u0ab5\u0aa4 \u0a9b\u0ac7.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{\u0ab9\u0ab5\u0ac7 \u0a9a\u0abe\u0ab2\u0acb \u0a9c\u0acb\u0a88\u0a8f \u0ab0\u0abf\u0ab2\u0abe\u0aaf\u0aa8\u0acd\u0ab8 \u0a9c\u0abf\u0