ction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{C}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 504, "output_tokens": 374, "total_tokens": 878}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "GeoBench_895", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: The deindustrialization process within First-World countries where the national economy shifts away from manufacturing and toward services commonly leads to\n\nOptions: \nA. decreased dependence on high technology and computers\nB. large numbers of factory workers being laid off and unemployed\nC. increased dependence on agricultural production and fisheries\nD. decreased need for workers with degrees from colleges and universities \nE. smaller numbers of services available in suburban areas\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{B}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 746, "output_tokens": 385, "total_tokens": 1131}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "GeoBench_902", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: One immediate and practical benefit that a nation receives from protecting its indigenous cultures is\n\nOptions: \nA. guaranteed monetary reward from international bodies dedicated to the preservation of disappearing indigenous cultures\nB. the ability to market this indigenous culture to the international tourism market\nC. a more peaceable population owing to universal representation and protection\nD. a gradual reduction in indigenous separatist movements\nE. the awareness that the indigenous art and language will be preserved for future generations\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{B}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 798, "output_tokens": 367, "total_tokens": 1165}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "GeoBench_916", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Improvements in health care systems, sanitation infrastructure, and personal nutrition are factors that lead to\n\nOptions: \nA. increased total fertility rates and higher birth rates\nB. increased birth rates and decreased life expectancy\nC. decreased life expectancy and increased total fertility rates\nD. increased infant mortality rates and increased total fertility rates\nE. decreased infant mortality rates and increased life expectancy\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{E}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 744, "output_tokens": 397, "total_tokens": 1141}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "GeoBench_938", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the 