": "GeoBench_968", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: A small family-run farm in an LDC that produces a variety of crops including corn, vegetables, eggs, and milk would most likely be an example of\n\nOptions: \nA. crop rotation \nB. subsistence farming\nC. export-based agriculture\nD. monoculture\nE. plantation farming\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{B}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 511, "output_tokens": 262, "total_tokens": 773}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "GeoBench_989", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: NATO and the Warsaw Pact can be best described as\n\nOptions: \nA. regional organizations based on economic cooperation\nB. early attempts at free-trade zones in Europe\nC. partners in combating irredentism in the former Yugoslavia\nD. military allies during World War II\nE. supranational organizations based on military cooperation\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{E}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 632, "output_tokens": 270, "total_tokens": 902}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "GeoBench_998", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Which of the following statements accurately describes the differences between a cylindrical and a conic map?\n\nOptions: \nA. A cylindrical shows true direction and examines the Earth from one point, usually a polar projection, while a conic map breaks up the globe into continents and separates the oceans.\nB. A cylindrical map shows true direction but loses distance, while a conic map shows true direction but examines the Earth from one point, usually a pole or polar projection.\nC. A cylindrical map shows true direction but loses distance, while a conic map tries to keep distance but loses directional qualities.\nD. A cylindrical map shows distance but loses directional qualities, while a conic map tries to keep true direction but loses distance.\nE. A conic map is the commonplace name for a cylindrical map.\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{C}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 1062, "output_tokens": 394, "total_tokens": 1456}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "GeoBench_1001", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Which type of map is best suited for illustrating the weather?\n\nOptions: \nA. Cartograms\nB. Choropleth maps\nC. Flow-line maps\nD. Isoline maps\nE. Thematic maps\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-2