gration\nE. Transmigration\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{C}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 568, "output_tokens": 351, "total_tokens": 919}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "GeoBench_1027", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Traditionally, nation-states, such as Japan, Iceland and Denmark, can best be characterized as having\n\nOptions: \nA. an ethnically diverse population\nB. multiple official languages\nC. strong centripetal forces\nD. democratic institutions\nE. many ties to international organizations\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{C}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 584, "output_tokens": 442, "total_tokens": 1026}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "GeoBench_1067", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: The table above best exemplifies which of the following concepts?\n\nOptions: \nA. Contagious diffusion\nB. Stimulus diffusion\nC. Relocation diffusion\nD. Hierarchical diffusion\nE. Expansion diffusion\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{D}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 483, "output_tokens": 390, "total_tokens": 873}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "GeoBench_1070", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Which of the following best explains the primary difference between \"site\" and \"situation\"?\n\nOptions: \nA. Site refers to a location\u2019s physical characteristics, while situation refers to the relationship between that location and the surrounding area.\nB. Site refers to the relationship between a location and the surrounding area, while situation refers to that location\u2019s intrinsic characteristics.\nC. Site refers to a permanent location, while situation refers to the temporary location of a society.\nD. Site refers to the natural resources available in a region, while situation refers to the manufactured products created from them.\nE. Site refers to an intentionally built community, while situation refers to a community that originates organically.\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{A}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 1000, "output_tokens": 365, "total_tokens": 1365}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "GeoBench_1073", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: The European Union (EU) is comprised of 28 member states, many of which share a common currency, and allows freedom of movement between countries within its boundaries. The EU can best be characterized as an example of which of the following?\n\nOptions: \nA. Perceptual region\nB. Functional region\nC. Agricultural region\nD. Formal region\nE. Cultural region\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{D}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 660, "output_tokens": 362, "total_tokens": 1022}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "GeoBench_1079", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: A person is trying to move from Miami to San Diego but decides to stop and stay in Dallas because he finds a better job. This is an example of which of the following?\n\nOptions: \nA. Intervening obstacle\nB. Intervening opportunity\nC. Environmental push factor\nD. Environmental pull factor\nE. Distance decay\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{B}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 589, "output_tokens": 286, "total_tokens": 875}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "GeoBench_1080", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: The J-curve, depicted in the image below, is used to illustrate which of the following geographic principles?\n\nOptions: \nA. The tendency for cities to be associated with each other based on their population sizes\nB. The logistic growth of a country\u2019s population\nC. The exponential growth of a country\u2019s population\nD. The openness and stability of countries over time\nE. Growth that occurs evenly across each unit of time\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{C}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 732, "output_tokens": 302, "total_tokens": 1034}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "GeoBench_1083", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Enslaved Africans were brought to the Americas and the Caribbean in exchange for goods as part of the triangular trade in the sixteenth century. Which of the following best describes this type of migration?\n\nOptions: \nA. Forced migration\nB. Transnational migration\nC. Internal migration\nD. Chain migration\nE. Step migration\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{A}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 602, "output_tokens": 326, "total_tokens": 928}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optim