ional companies\nE. The congregation of innovators in one area\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{C}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 724, "output_tokens": 414, "total_tokens": 1138}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "GeoBench_1315", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: The concept of the American South means many things to different people, and many people draw the South using different boundaries. This is an example of\n\nOptions: \nA. a formal region\nB. a functional region\nC. an industrial region\nD. an agricultural region\nE. a vernacular region\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{E}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 584, "output_tokens": 313, "total_tokens": 897}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "GeoBench_1324", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Pork production is almost nonexistent in the Islamic world. Which of the following statements best explains this lack of pork production?\n\nOptions: \nA. The climate of most countries with large Islamic populations is not well-suited for pork production.\nB. Religious guidelines 