, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "GeoBench_603", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: \n\nOptions: \nA. their experience with a baby bust\nB. their history of external war\nC. their gender imbalance\nD. their respective rates of growth\nE. their economic development\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{D}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 480, "output_tokens": 339, "total_tokens": 819}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "GeoBench_872", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: A young woman living in Namibia cannot find news about her homeland because the television stations and newspapers don't have enough money in their budgets to do investigations. Instead, she watches episodes of The Real Housewives of Atlanta for free on YouTube. Critics might call this an instance of\n\nOptions: \nA. contemporary culture region\nB. migration diffusion\nC. cultural imperialism\nD. transnationalism\nE. cultural synthesis\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{C}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 701, "output_tokens": 340, "total_tokens": 1041}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "GeoBench_660", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: The headwear portrayed in the photo is best interpreted as\n\nOptions: \nA. an instance of Islamic supremacy\nB. a key example of mainstream Arabic clothing customs\nC. an outdated regional clothing preference\nD. symbolic belief in the innate corruption of humans\nE. a strict interpretation of cultural rules governing modest dress\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{E}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 632, "output_tokens": 342, "total_tokens": 974}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "GeoBench_518", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Since pure water is only found in a laboratory and fish need dissolved oxygen to survive, what do hydrologists test when checking the health of fresh water?\n\nOptions: \nA. Chlorination levels\nB. Total organic carbon (TOC)\nC. Regeneration capacity\nD. Phytoplankton levels\nE. Volatile organic compounds (VOCs)\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{B}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 612, "output_tokens": 385, "total_tokens": 997}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "GeoBench_230", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: All the following are good sites for wind turbines except\n\nOptions: \nA. forests\nB. coastal areas\nC. plains\nD. mountain passes\nE. open ocean\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{A}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 433, "output_tokens": 315, "total_tokens": 748}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "GeoBench_537", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Using the figure below asdf, what is the approximate LD50 dose (PPM) of the illustrated pollutant?\n\nOptions: \nA. 8\nB. 10\nC. 13\nD. 25\nE. 100\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{C}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 444, "output_tokens": 306, "total_tokens": 750}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "GeoBench_644", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: The Abrahamic tradition is most distinct from the Hindu-Buddhist tradition in\n\nOptions: \nA. the willingness of