tiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Which of the following best explains how the Green Revolution has impacted the carrying capacity of land?\n\nOptions: \nA. The Green Revolution produced technology that has gradually decreased the carrying capacity of land.\nB. The Green Revolution shifted efforts from hunting and gathering to planting, leading to greater carrying capacity.\nC. The Green Revolution led to populations exceeding a land\u2019s carrying capacity.\nD. The Green Revolution led to environmental degradation, resulting in a lower carrying capacity.\nE. The Green Revolution produced technology that has increased food productivity, leading to greater carrying capacity.\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{E}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 688, "output_tokens": 244, "total_tokens": 932}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "GeoBench_1096", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Which of the following groups would be least likely to be considered  refugees?\n\nOptions: \nA. The Jews who emigrated during World War II\nB. Those who emigrated from Rwanda and Uganda in the 1990s\nC. Those who moved from the former Yugoslavia to neighboring countries in the 1990s\nD. Those who voluntarily moved from the Middle East to Dearborn, Michigan, in the 1920s\nE. The Hmong who migrated to the United States after the Vietnam War\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{D}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 740, "output_tokens": 336, "total_tokens": 1076}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "GeoBench_1144", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Which of the following is the best example of voluntary segregation?\n\nOptions: \nA. Ethnic neighborhoods in New York City\nB. Ghettos during World War II in Poland\nC. Palestinian refugee camps in Jordan\nD. Relocation of South Africans during apartheid\nE. 19th-century American Indian reservations in the United States\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{A}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 620, "output_tokens": 375, "total_tokens": 995}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "GeoBench_1163", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Which of the following best explains recent trends in agriculture in the United States?\n\nOptions: \nA. The average size of farms is decreasing as American farmers\u2019 efficiency increases.\nB. The number of family-owned farms is continuing to increase.\nC. The total revenue of agricultural sales is becoming more concentrated in a small number of large corporate farms.\nD. The cost of converting a conventional farm into a farm that grows certified organic crops is relatively quick and easy.\nE. Sustainable farms make up only a small percentage of total agricultural sales, and their numbers are declining.\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{C}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 859, "output_tokens": 347, "total_tokens": 1206}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "GeoBench_1169", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Which of the following describes a problem with the concentric zone model?\n\nOptions: \nA. It was modeled on Chicago, which never had concentric zones.\nB. Most cities today are no longer organized in clear zones.\nC. Wealthy residents actually prefer to live far from the central business district.\nD. It applies well to European cities but not to other cities.\nE. It incorporates globalization too heavily.\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{B}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 677, "output_tokens": 382, "total_tokens": 1059}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "GeoBench_1200", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Which of 