} \\, \\text{J T}^{-1}\\).\n\n\\boxed{J}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 864, "output_tokens": 542, "total_tokens": 1406}, "model_used": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "MMLUPro_chemistry_3974", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: When using the ideal gas law, standard conditions for temperature and pressure are\n\nOptions: \nA. 25 \u00b0C and 1 atmosphere pressure\nB. 32 \u00b0F and 1 atmosphere pressure\nC. 0 \u00b0C and 760 torr\nD. 0 K and 0 torr\nE. 0 K and 1 atmosphere pressure\nF. 25 \u00b0C and 760 torr\nG. 20 \u00b0C and 1 bar pressure\nH. 0 \u00b0F and 1 atmosphere pressure\nI. 0 \u00b0C and 0 torr\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{C}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 780, "output_tokens": 332, "total_tokens": 1112}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "MMLUPro_chemistry_4414", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: A substance that is NOT generally considered to be a toxic pollutant in water is\n\nOptions: \nA. nitrogen\nB. a halogenated hydrocarbon\nC. chlorine\nD. copper\nE. arsenic\nF. benzene\nG. carbonic acid\nH. mercury\nI. cyanide\nJ. lead\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "g