rovider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "QANTA_Science_619", "prompt": "Please read the following question and provide the correct answer.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: A subset of this set of numbers corresponds to the surreal numbers with birthdays earlier than omega; those surreal numbers are the dyadic type of this number.\n\nProvide the correct answer in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct and the most common answer to the question. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{dyadic rationals}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 356, "output_tokens": 307, "total_tokens": 663}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "QANTA_Science_229", "prompt": "Please read the following question and provide the correct answer.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: The genotype of this compound's receptor significantly correlates with disease subtype in leprosy patients.\n\nProvide the correct answer in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct and the most common answer to the question. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{VDR}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 353, "output_tokens": 399, "total_tokens": 752}, "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "provider": "openrouter", "error": null}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "QANTA_Science_181", "prompt": "Please read the following question and provide the correct answer.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Some of these devices feature glass fibers that are woven together into an absorbent mat to protect a component that nowadays is often made by mixing sulfuric acid and